{"sections":[{"slug":"Langlands对偶","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Langlands对偶"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对偶群</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Langlands 对偶群"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/约化群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">约化</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span> ${^LG}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是置换其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/根","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">根</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">数据所得的另一个代数群</span>.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Langlands对应","text":"Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span>"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">将</span>\n$G$ (<span lang=\"zh\">准确地说是</span> $G(\\mathbb A_F)$) <span lang=\"zh\">的自守表示联系到</span> $^LG$-<span lang=\"zh\">值的</span> Galois <span lang=\"zh\">表示</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即同态</span> $\\mathrm {Gal}(\\overline{F}/F)\\to {^LG}$).</p>\n<p>Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对偶群也可由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/佐武等价","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">佐武等价</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">规范理论中的</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span></h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A gauge theory has a coupling constant $g$, which plays the role of the electric charge $e$. The conjectural non-abelian electro-magnetic duality, which has later become known as $S$-duality, has the form $(G, g) \\leftrightarrow (^LG, 1/g)$.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Langlands纲领","text":"Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">纲领</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部几何Langlands对应","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部几何</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}